# Packages published at https://npm.skymob.app — this file IS the promotion
# decision. Only the versions named here are served, so publishing a version to
# GitHub Packages reaches library authors only once it is promoted here.
#
# Edit it with New-NpmPromotion / Remove-NpmPromotion (Promote.psm1), not by
# hand: the matching hash in SHA256SUMS moves with it, and the publish workflow
# refuses a commit where the two disagree.
#
# Format: "<package> <version> <promoted-at>", one per line. <promoted-at> is
# the UTC time of the promotion; the index gives it to clients as the version's
# publish time, which pnpm's minimumReleaseAge counts from.
#
# A version range resolves among the versions listed here. A lock file names
# its version's tarball on the pool release directly, so it keeps installing
# while that file stays on the release.
